        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About This Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An alien ship has crash-landed on prehistoric Earth. Stranded and far from home, the survivors find themselves surrounded by primitive humans. The only way back to the stars? Ignite the spark of civilization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Click To Civ</strong> is an incremental game with active clicking where you collect ancient <strong>civilization badges</strong> and grow your hometown into a thriving hub of progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959250/extras/fcf37c8564c5dee00581329427fe4360.poster.avif?t=1783290777\" width=1170 height=422 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959250/extras/fcf37c8564c5dee00581329427fe4360.webm?t=1783290777\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959250/extras/fcf37c8564c5dee00581329427fe4360.mp4?t=1783290777\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay Loops</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Caves</strong>: Explore mysterious caves, strike monolith-like rocks, and uncover badges hidden within. Each smash carries a chance to reward you with fragments of long-lost knowledge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hometown</strong>: Place your collected badges in your settlement. The more you gather, the higher the badge level — and the more gold your village produces passively over time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Also, you can click the badges to harvest gold instantly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959250/extras/22e8d42ed9af26d8195995b4e3419207.poster.avif?t=1783290777\" width=1170 height=828 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959250/extras/22e8d42ed9af26d8195995b4e3419207.webm?t=1783290777\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959250/extras/22e8d42ed9af26d8195995b4e3419207.mp4?t=1783290777\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >From Clicks to Automation</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your journey begins with manual clicks, but as your civilization advances, powerful automated systems take over. Develop technology that mines the caves for you, transforming your hard labor into a self-sufficient engine of progress. Witness your civilization's power grow as you shift from active clicking to strategic oversight, ensuring growth continues without finger fatigue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959250/extras/8a8358eed867b948c06f1cbd75d6a2f0.poster.avif?t=1783290777\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959250/extras/8a8358eed867b948c06f1cbd75d6a2f0.webm?t=1783290777\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959250/extras/8a8358eed867b948c06f1cbd75d6a2f0.mp4?t=1783290777\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Item System: Endless Variations</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start each game with a <strong>unique item loadout</strong> that reshapes your strategy and choices. No two playthroughs are the same — experiment with powerful item combinations and discover new ways to lead your civilization to greatness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959250/extras/66575fdaa09afac58206d81b1a604320.poster.avif?t=1783290777\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959250/extras/66575fdaa09afac58206d81b1a604320.webm?t=1783290777\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959250/extras/66575fdaa09afac58206d81b1a604320.mp4?t=1783290777\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Thrill of Discovery: Unlock Powerful Chests</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The true engine of your advancement lies in the chests you unearth. Every chest you open reveals powerful **items** that are key to your progress. This core loop of discovery and reward is where strategy truly unfolds. Will you find an item that multiplies your click power or a schematic that skyrockets your automated production? Each chest opens a new path to the stars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959250/extras/490028400867e0f4509095751df82b20.poster.avif?t=1783290777\" width=1170 height=548 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959250/extras/490028400867e0f4509095751df82b20.webm?t=1783290777\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959250/extras/490028400867e0f4509095751df82b20.mp4?t=1783290777\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Progression Through Simplicity</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Badges are the heart of your progress. Every badge you earn drives your hometown to grow faster, stronger, and richer.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Theme</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From humble caves of stone to the dream of interstellar flight, guide humanity’s first steps into civilization. Your mission: help the survivors rebuild, advance, and one day launch a starship to return to their homeworld.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Addictive clicker-core gameplay, instantly easy to grasp</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A meaningful progression from active clicking to powerful automation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A core loop of chest discovery that fuels your growth</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Randomized item system for dynamic replayability</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Relaxing yet rewarding progression</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A mix of mystery and sci-fi woven into a simple Stone Age setting</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No clutter, no unnecessary complexity — just pure progression. Can you spark civilization and lead humanity back to the stars?</p>",
