s first steps into civilization. Your mission: help the survivors rebuild, advance, and one day launch a starship to return to their homeworld.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Addictive clicker-core gameplay, instantly easy to grasp</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A meaningful progression from active clicking to powerful automation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A core loop of chest discovery that fuels your growth</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Randomized item system for dynamic replayability</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Relaxing yet rewarding progression</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A mix of mystery and sci-fi woven into a simple Stone Age setting</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No clutter, no unnecessary complexity — just pure progression. Can you spark civilization and lead humanity back to the stars?</p>",
